{"id":600,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"Many companies in the Galar region choose Klang as their logo. This Pokémon is considered the symbol of industrial technology."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"When Klang goes all out, the minigear links up perfectly with the outer part of the big gear, and this Pokémon’s rotation speed increases sharply."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","White 2","Black 2"],"text":"A minigear and big gear comprise its body. If the minigear it launches at a foe doesn’t return, it will die."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","Black"],"text":"By changing the direction in which it rotates, it communicates its feelings to others. When angry, it rotates faster."},{"games":["White"],"text":"Spinning minigears are rotated at high speed and repeatedly fired away. It is dangerous if the gears don’t return."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Plus","hidden":false,"description":"Boosts the Sp. Atk stat of the Pokémon if an ally with the Plus or Minus Ability is also in battle."},{"name":"Minus","hidden":false,"description":"Boosts the Sp. Atk stat of the Pokémon if an ally with the Plus or Minus Ability is also in battle."},{"name":"Clear Body","hidden":true,"description":"Prevents other Pokémon's moves or Abilities from lowering the Pokémon's stats."}],"eggGroups":["Mineral"],"genderRate":-1,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":null,"color":"Gray","shape":"Heads","evolution":{"id":599,"name":"Klink","condition":null,"children":[{"id":600,"name":"Klang","condition":"Lv. 38","children":[{"id":601,"name":"Klinklang","condition":"Lv. 49","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Sword / Shield","level":[[1,11],[1,20],[1,84],[1,268],[12,451],[16,319],[20,475],[24,435],[28,103],[32,544],[36,199],[42,508],[48,192],[54,63]],"machine":[502,372,203,263,430,63,334,408,182,156,496,201,103,214,173,164,86,85,253,521,528],"egg":[],"tutor":[804,796,798]},"cards":[{"id":"zsv10pt5-140","name":"Klang","set":"Black Bolt","date":"2025-07-18","rarity":"Illu